```java
class Outer {
    private int x = 10;
    class Inner {
        private int x = 20;
        void print() {
            int x = 30;
            System.out.print(x + " "); // (1)
            System.out.print(this.x + " "); // (2)
            System.out.print(Outer.this.x); // (3)
        }
    }
}
```
